{"obs_mqz30eod_333b9461e52e":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqz30eod_333b9461e52e","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"command\":\"ssh davec@192.168.88.21 'cat \\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\davec\\\\\\\\AppData\\\\\\\\Local\\\\\\\\hermes\\\\\\\\.env\\\"'\"}","duration_ms":3521,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"output\": \"Warning: Permanently added '192.168.88.21' (ED25519) to the list of known hosts.\\r\\n'cat' is not recognized as an internal or external command,\\r\\noperable program or batch file.\", \"exit_code\": 1, \"error\": null}","status":"ok","task_id":"20260629_044157_a49924","tool_call_id":"call_83a502d8e2d549afbd3a8f31","tool_name":"terminal","turn_id":"20260629_044157_a49924:20260629_044157_a49924:96494fb1"},"sessionId":"20260629_053500_2018f7","timestamp":"2026-06-29T10:35:24.872664+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqz34otj_91348b30594c":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqz34otj_91348b30594c","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"name\":\"hermes-agent\"}","duration_ms":60,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"name\": \"hermes-agent\", \"description\": \"Configure, extend, or contribute to Hermes Agent.\", \"tags\": [\"hermes\", \"setup\", \"configuration\", \"multi-agent\", \"spawning\", \"cli\", \"gateway\", \"development\"], \"related_skills\": [\"claude-code\", \"codex\", \"opencode\"], \"content\": \"---\\nname: hermes-agent\\ndescription: \\\"Configure, extend, or contribute to Hermes Agent.\\\"\\nversion: 2.1.0\\nauthor: Hermes Agent + Teknium\\nlicense: MIT\\nplatforms: [linux, macos, windows]\\nmetadata:\\n  hermes:\\n    tags: [hermes, setup, configuration, multi-agent, spawning, cli, gateway, development]\\n    homepage: https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent\\n    related_skills: [claude-code, codex, opencode]\\n---\\n\\n# Hermes Agent\\n\\nHermes Agent is an open-source AI agent framework by Nous Research that runs in your terminal, messaging platforms, and IDEs. It belongs to the same category as Claude Code (Anthropic), Codex (OpenAI), and OpenClaw â€” autonomous coding and task-execution agents that use tool...","status":"ok","task_id":"e6bbc850-faa0-4238-a8b3-7b489c7ae39f","tool_call_id":"call_50b22c3de86f45979cfee624","tool_name":"skill_view","turn_id":"20260629_053500_2018f7:e6bbc850-faa0-4238-a8b3-7b489c7ae39f:4dc0686e"},"sessionId":"20260629_053500_2018f7","timestamp":"2026-06-29T10:38:44.631075+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqz34oto_98277acc8eed":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqz34oto_98277acc8eed","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"name\":\"hermes-webui\"}","duration_ms":68,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"name\": \"hermes-webui\", \"description\": \"Configure, manage, and troubleshoot the Hermes WebUI (server.py on port 8787) â€” password discovery, authentication, binding, and env vars.\", \"tags\": [\"hermes\", \"webui\", \"password\", \"config\", \"troubleshooting\"], \"related_skills\": [], \"content\": \"---\\nname: hermes-webui\\ndescription: \\\"Configure, manage, and troubleshoot the Hermes WebUI (server.py on port 8787) â€” password discovery, authentication, binding, and env vars.\\\"\\nversion: 1.2.0\\nauthor: Hermes Agent\\ntags: [hermes, webui, password, config, troubleshooting]\\n---\\n\\n# Hermes WebUI Configuration & Management\\n\\nThe Hermes WebUI runs `server.py` from `~/hermes-webui/` (or wherever installed), typically on port 8787. It can be launched by the Hermes desktop app or manually. Password and binding behavior differ depending on launch method.\\n\\n## Password Discovery\\n\\nWhen launched by the **desktop app**, the password is set via the `HERMES_WEBUI_PASSWORD` env var â€” it is NOT ...","status":"ok","task_id":"e6bbc850-faa0-4238-a8b3-7b489c7ae39f","tool_call_id":"call_c3b982d3369d406fb982ad03","tool_name":"skill_view","turn_id":"20260629_053500_2018f7:e6bbc850-faa0-4238-a8b3-7b489c7ae39f:4dc0686e"},"sessionId":"20260629_053500_2018f7","timestamp":"2026-06-29T10:38:44.633274+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqz357t6_1c3814777081":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqz357t6_1c3814777081","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"action\":\"patch\",\"name\":\"hermes-webui\",\"old_string\":\"## Remote Gateway Connectivity (Client-Side)\\n\\nWhen a remote Hermes CLI or desktop (e.g., Windows PC) tries to connect to a Mac's WebUI as its backend gateway, it uses **WebSocket** to `/ws`. This has different auth behavior than the browser:\\n\\n**Symptom:** Remote client shows \\\"can't connect\\\" or falls back to local gateway. HTTP works from the client but the client's TUI/gateway doesn't function.\",\"new_string\":\"## Architecture: WebUI Is N...","duration_ms":22,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"message\": \"Patched SKILL.md in skill 'hermes-webui' (1 replacement).\", \"_change\": {\"old\": \"## Remote Gateway Connectivity (Client-Side)\\n\\nWhen a remote Hermes CLI or desktop (e.g., Windows PC) tries to connect to a Mac's WebUI as its backend gateway, it uses **WebSocket** to `/ws`. This has â€¦\", \"new\": \"## Architecture: WebUI Is NOT a Model API Endpoint\\n\\n**Critical distinction:** hermes-webui is a full agent dashboard that runs `hermes-agent` as a **subprocess**. It is NOT an OpenAI-compatible model â€¦\"}}","status":"ok","task_id":"e6bbc850-faa0-4238-a8b3-7b489c7ae39f","tool_call_id":"call_d56b36cfa39349bc95f6bdd2","tool_name":"skill_manage","turn_id":"20260629_053500_2018f7:e6bbc850-faa0-4238-a8b3-7b489c7ae39f:4dc0686e"},"sessionId":"20260629_053500_2018f7","timestamp":"2026-06-29T10:39:09.248820+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqz3fuuc_d7124254f090":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqz3fuuc_d7124254f090","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"command\":\"# Get the actual KILOCODE_API_KEY from the Mac (first 10 chars only)\\ngrep \\\"^KILOCODE_API_KEY\\\" /Users/davec/.hermes/.env | awk -F= '{print substr($2,1,10) \\\"...\\\"